    <p>Exact options vary by product — see the packaging section on each product page for what's typically available, and tell us your preferred format when you request a quote.</p>

    <h2>Labelling</h2>
    <p>We can apply neutral export labelling, or your own artwork for a private-label order. Labels are typically produced in English by default; multi-language labelling for a specific destination market can be arranged — tell us what your import regulations require (ingredient lists, net weight declarations, country-of-origin marking, etc.) and we'll confirm what we can accommodate.</p>

    <h2>Private label &amp; custom packaging</h2>
    <p>For bulk buyers wanting their own brand on retail-ready packaging, see <a href="/private-label-bulk-supply/">Private Label &amp; Bulk Supply</a>.</p>

    <h2>Container loading</h2>
    <p>Packaging format affects how much product fits per container. Use our <a href="/resources/container-loading-calculator/">Container Loading Calculator</a> for an estimate based on your chosen bag/carton size.</p>
